<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 7 bln skr worth of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 7 bln skr worth of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would auction seven billion crowns worth of seven day Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The office said bids had to be received by 1000 GMT on March 4. The lowest accepted volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>The paper will mature on March 12.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
